  "readingTheNumbers": "The pack is STRATIFIED and deliberately over-weights the cells most likely to fail - the band just above the tangential threshold, structures just outside the match radius, same-named roads that DUPLICATE_GEOMETRY did not catch, unsealed access roads. So these are PERFORMANCE ON A DELIBERATELY DIFFICULT, STRATIFIED HOLDOUT. This is not a probability sample and is not an estimate or formal lower bound on national precision. The Wilson bound applies to this holdout reviewed cases, not to a nationally weighted population.",
