  "retractedClaim": "This field previously called the figures a conservative floor. That was not established and is withdrawn. A floor is a claim about the POPULATION - it says national precision is at least this - and it needs the strata to be a probability sample with population weights. These cells overlap, they were chosen for being hard, and no weights exist. Over-weighting hard cases makes a number likely to be pessimistic; it does not make it a bound."
